# ── Mode ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DEMO_MODE=true runs the whole bot flow with no wallet, no gas and no
# chain: launches return a pseudo address and the threshold metric climbs
# on a timer so locks unlock in a few minutes. Telegram and Postgres are
# still required, because the bot cannot be faked. Set to false to go live.
DEMO_MODE=true

# ── Telegram ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Token from @BotFather. The username is the bot's @handle without the @;
# it goes into the deeplinks and the message the creator pastes to the fan.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_BOT_USERNAME=
# Optional. When set, Telegram pushes updates to ${WEBHOOK_URL}/webhook and
# long polling is off. Leave empty for local development.
WEBHOOK_URL=

# ── Database (Postgres) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tables are created on boot. Any Postgres works, local or hosted.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/chat_launch

# ── Chain (live mode only) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# One server wallet signs and pays gas for every launch. Fund it with ETH
# on Base and keep its key out of git. See src/doppler/launch.ts for the
# balance floor and the per-creator rate limit that protect it.
SERVER_PRIVATE_KEY=
BASE_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.base.org
# Refuse to launch when the server wallet holds less than this (wei).
MIN_SERVER_BALANCE_WEI=2000000000000000
# Launches one creator may start per hour.
MAX_LAUNCHES_PER_CREATOR_PER_HOUR=3

# ── Doppler ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Indexer used by the poller for the threshold metric, and the token page
# linked in bot messages.
DOPPLER_INDEXER_URL=https://indexer.doppler.lol
TOKEN_PAGE_BASE=https://app.doppler.lol/tokens

# ── Web server ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# APP_URL is the public origin of this server. Each token's URI is
# ${APP_URL}/api/metadata/<launchId>, so it must be reachable from the
# internet in live mode. Serve a token image at ${APP_URL}/token-image.png.
APP_URL=
PORT=3000

# The course fee recipient is not an env var on purpose. It lives in
# src/course-fee.ts and is a default the course relies on.
